[00:35.28] "In the constellation of Cygnus
[00:36.51] There lurks a mysterious, invisible force
[00:39.79] The black hole of Cygnus X-1
[00:48.66] Six stars of the Northern Cross
[00:51.64] In mourning for their sister's loss
[00:55.29] In a final flash of glory
[00:57.39] Nevermore to grace the night"
[05:04.03] Invisible to telescopic eye
[05:08.40] Infinity, the star that would not die
[05:16.56] All who dare to cross her course
[05:20.09] Are swallowed by a fearsome force
[05:24.97] Through the void, to be destroyed
[05:29.49] Or is there something more?
[05:33.74] Atomized at the core
[05:38.10] Or through the astral door
[05:42.51] To soar
[06:01.19] I set a course just east of Lyra
[06:04.41] And northwest of Pegasus
[06:06.92] Flew into the light of Deneb
[06:10.40] Sailed across the Milky Way
[06:13.33] On my ship, the Rocinante
[06:16.25] Wheeling through the galaxies
[06:19.50] Headed for the heart of Cygnus
[06:22.52] Headlong into mystery
[06:30.42] The X-ray is her siren song, my ship cannot resist her long
[06:34.45] Nearer to my deadly goal, until the black hole
[06:38.92] Gains control
[08:58.76] Spinning, whirling, still descending
[09:00.80] Like a spiral sea, unending!
[09:27.00] Sound and fury drowns my heart
[09:28.65] Every nerve is torn apart!
[09:33.98] 